Hi,

last weekend the Linux App Summit 2022 in Rovereto, Italy, hosted by the 
GNOME and KDE projects, has taken place.

See my News Flash:

https://openprinting.github.io/OpenPrinting-News-Flash-OpenPrinting-and-Ubuntu-on-the-Linux-App-Summit-2022/

Here you can watch all talks on YouTube.

I have given a talk about the New Architecture and what app/GUI 
developers need to know, a lightning talk to announce the Ubuntu Summit 
in Prague in November, and have participated in the virtual release 
party for Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, telling about the latest and greatest about 
printing with Ubuntu.

My News Flash also links other great talks of the Canonical Gang!

    Till
